## Why This Is Asked

This question tests privacy-first, scalable analytics across regions with data contracts.

## Key Concepts

- Per-region pseudonymization
- Iceberg upserts
- Event-time windows and lateness handling
- Immutable audits and data contracts
- Spark vs Flink trade-offs for streaming

## Code Example

```javascript
// Region-aware salt hash (Node.js)
const crypto = require('crypto');
function saltedHash(region, id, salts){
  const salt = salts[region] ?? salts.default;
  return crypto.createHash('sha256').update(id + salt).digest('hex');
}
```

